note empty_text_part: known defect at the pin (omega-mv #775): an empty text passed to an unsized view
note does not arrive with len 0. Workaround, shown here: pass part e 0 0, which arrives with len 0
om2
text e ""
text f "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef"
fn n a view uchar * to ulong
ret len a
end
fn main to int
k = n part e 0 0
if ne k 0
ret 1
end
m = n f
if ne m 32
ret 2
end
ret 0
end
